{"id":"quelquefois","lemma":"quelquefois","pos":"adv","rank":4364,"glosses":["sometimes"],"ipa":"/kɛl.kə.fwa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/87/Fr-quelquefois.ogg/Fr-quelquefois.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Il est quelquefois absent de l'école.","en":"He is sometimes absent from school.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"absent"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Vas-tu quelquefois en vacances à l'étranger ?","en":"Do you sometimes go abroad on your holidays?","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"vacancy","l":"vacance"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"foreigner"}]},{"text":"Quelquefois, les rêves deviennent réalité.","en":"Dreams sometimes come true.","words":[null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"dream","l":"rêve"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},{"g":"reality"}]},{"text":"Tom va au travail à pied quelquefois.","en":"Tom sometimes walks to work.","words":[null,{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"get to work! let's get…"],[4,6,"on foot"]]},{"text":"Quelquefois j'entends mon père chanter dans la salle de bain.","en":"I sometimes hear my father singing in the bathroom.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"entendre"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,11,"bathroom"]]}]}